<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  com.gulasz101.hermes-memory-watchdog — hourly health check of the Hermes
  memory config and of the state.db backup JOB. SYSTEM LaunchDaemon (GUL-618).

  Why it is a daemon: it is the thing that notices a silent failure, and on
  2026-10-29 it went silent itself. The WindowServer kill at 09:39:16 tore down
  the Aqua session; the last log line is 08:41 and nothing has run since. A
  watchdog that only runs while a human is logged in cannot watch an appliance
  that runs with nobody logged in (ADR-107). Worse than useless: it reads as
  healthy from the outside.

  UserName is required (a LaunchDaemon defaults to root) and HOME is required,
  because every default here is $HOME-based and launchd does not guarantee HOME
  for system daemons. HERMES_HOME is explicit for the same reason as the backup
  job: the script is installed outside the Hermes tree.

  The script's check 5b asks launchd about the backup job. Since GUL-618 that
  job lives in system/, so the script probes system/ first and gui/<uid> second
  — the old gui-only probe would have alerted "not scheduled at all" every hour
  after this move.

  ssh to homelab-2nd for checks 6 and 8 needs HOME: ssh reads ~/.ssh/config and
  ~/.ssh/keys relative to it, and under a system daemon there is no inherited
  HOME to fall back on.

  Install: sudo ./bin/homelab-install-scheduled-jobs.sh
  Prove it:
    sudo launchctl print system/com.gulasz101.hermes-memory-watchdog | head -20
    sudo launchctl kickstart -k system/com.gulasz101.hermes-memory-watchdog
    tail -3 ~/.hermes/logs/hermes-memory-watchdog.log
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.gulasz101.hermes-memory-watchdog</string>

  <key>UserName</key>
  <string>paperclip</string>

  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>/usr/local/libexec/homelab/hermes-memory-watchdog.sh</string>
  </array>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>/usr/local/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>/Users/paperclip</string>
    <key>HERMES_HOME</key>
    <string>/Users/paperclip/.hermes</string>
  </dict>

  <key>StartInterval</key>
  <integer>3600</integer>

  <key>ProcessType</key>
  <string>Background</string>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/paperclip/.hermes/logs/hermes-memory-watchdog.launchd.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/paperclip/.hermes/logs/hermes-memory-watchdog.launchd.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
